2100-03-01 12:00:00

=== plus geht ueber alle grenzen[2000-02-28 12:00:00-86400-2000-02-29 12:00:00]
IMPORT "zeit"
PRINT ZEIT_TEXT$(ZEIT_PLUS(ZEIT_PARSE("2000-02-28 12:00:00"), 86400))
